sequenceDiagram
    participant Visitor
    participant Browser
    participant Repo as Static file host
    participant CDN as jsDelivr
    Visitor->>Browser: Open Task HTML
    Browser->>Repo: Request HTML
    Repo-->>Browser: Return page markup
    Browser->>Repo: Request local media file
    Repo-->>Browser: Return image
    Browser->>CDN: Request Bootstrap CSS and JS
    CDN-->>Browser: Return framework assets
    Browser->>Browser: Render Bootstrap UI
